[[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K46</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the engine rpm sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064502.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the rpm sensor (1a) in place and secure it tightening the\nbolt (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE RPM SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 0.8 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K46</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064503.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]